 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Records [orderId, \"HH:MM\", status] (any order, one day). Each order has one ACCEPTED record and at most one CANCELED or DELIVERED record at or after it. The dasher earns 30 cents per minute per active delivered order between ACCEPTED and DELIVERED; canceled or unfinished orders earn nothing. Concurrent orders each earn (rate times concurrency). Return total pay in integer cents.",
